---
// 01 · 질문: 한 사람의 뇌를 예측하고 제어할 수 있을까?
// 소프트웨어 뇌 모델이 중심, 하드웨어는 감지(뇌 → 모델)와 작용(모델 → 뇌)의 두 통로.
---
<section class="question" id="question" aria-labelledby="question-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker mono">01 / The question</p>
    <h2 id="question-h">Can we predict and control an individual brain?</h2>
    <p class="dek">The same stimulation can produce different responses in different people. The core is a software model of one brain: hardware reads from it and writes to it, and every response updates the model.</p>

    <figure class="arch" aria-label="Research asks what we should learn. A software brain model predicts and controls. It reads the brain through sensing hardware and writes to it through stimulation hardware. The brain's response updates the model.">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 600 540" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <marker id="qa" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 1 L9 5 L0 9" fill="none" stroke="#8a8a8a" stroke-width="1.4" /></marker>
          <marker id="qb" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 1 L9 5 L0 9" fill="none" stroke="#a8c8ff" stroke-width="1.4" /></marker>
          <path id="q-up" d="M262 408 H130 V338 M130 256 V214 H300 V162" />
          <path id="q-dn" d="M300 162 V214 H470 V256 M470 338 V408 H338" />
          <path id="q-upd" d="M300 448 V500 H585 V122 H422" />
        </defs>
        <text class="k" x="300" y="22" text-anchor="middle">RESEARCH</text>
        <text class="v" x="300" y="48" text-anchor="middle">What should we learn?</text>
        <path class="ln" d="M300 58 V80" marker-end="url(#qa)" />

        <rect class="m" x="180" y="82" width="240" height="80" />
        <text class="t" x="300" y="118" text-anchor="middle">BRAIN MODEL</text>
        <text class="k" x="300" y="144" text-anchor="middle">SOFTWARE</text>

        <path class="ln" d="M300 162 V214 M130 214 H470" />
        <text class="v" x="312" y="194">predict · control</text>
        <path class="ln" d="M130 256 V218" marker-end="url(#qa)" />
        <path class="ln" d="M470 214 V254" marker-end="url(#qa)" />
        <text class="t3" x="118" y="242" text-anchor="end">READ</text>
        <text class="t3" x="482" y="242">WRITE</text>

        <rect class="b" x="40" y="256" width="180" height="82" />
        <text class="t2" x="130" y="290" text-anchor="middle">SENSING</text>
        <text class="s" x="130" y="316" text-anchor="middle">hardware</text>
        <rect class="b" x="380" y="256" width="180" height="82" />
        <text class="t2" x="470" y="290" text-anchor="middle">STIMULATE</text>
        <text class="s" x="470" y="316" text-anchor="middle">hardware</text>

        <path class="ln" d="M130 340 V408 H262" marker-start="url(#qa)" />
        <path class="ln" d="M470 338 V408 H338" marker-end="url(#qa)" />
        <path class="brain" d="M300 370 C276 370 262 382 262 400 C262 420 280 432 300 430 C320 432 338 420 338 400 C338 382 324 370 300 370 Z M300 372 V428 M276 390 C286 396 288 406 280 416 M324 390 C314 396 312 406 320 416" />
        <text class="t2" x="288" y="468" text-anchor="end">BRAIN</text>

        <path class="up" d="M300 432 V500 H585 V122 H424" marker-end="url(#qb)" />
        <text class="s" x="312" y="468">response</text>
        <text class="u" x="572" y="526" text-anchor="end">MODEL UPDATE</text>

        <circle class="p" r="5"><animateMotion dur="5s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#q-up" /></animateMotion></circle>
        <circle class="p" r="5"><animateMotion dur="5s" begin="-2.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#q-dn" /></animateMotion></circle>
        <circle class="p" r="4"><animateMotion dur="6s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#q-upd" /></animateMotion></circle>
      </svg>
    </figure>
    <p class="note">Control and memory are the same problem: what state is this brain in, and what information does it hold?</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .question { --acc: #a8c8ff; background: #000; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-block: clamp(96px, 16vw, 200px) clamp(80px, 12vw, 150px); }
  .kicker { color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 28px; }
  h2 {
    margin: 0; max-width: 17ch; color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6.6vw, 96px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .dek { max-width: 54ch; margin: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px) 0 0; color: #a9a9a9; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 20px); line-height: 1.6; }

  .arch { margin: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px) auto 0; max-width: 680px; }
  .arch svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .arch .m { fill: #060a10; stroke: var(--acc); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .arch .b { fill: #050505; stroke: #bdbdbd; stroke-width: 1.1; }
  .arch .ln { fill: none; stroke: #8a8a8a; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .arch .brain { fill: #050505; stroke: #d6d6d6; stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .arch .k { fill: #7d7d7d; font: 14px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .arch .t { fill: #fff; font: 500 24px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .arch .z { fill: var(--acc); font: 22px var(--mono); }
  .arch .t2 { fill: #fff; font: 500 19px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .arch .s { fill: #8a8a8a; font: 17px var(--mono); }
  .arch .s2 { fill: #6a6a6a; font: 16px var(--mono); }
  .arch .v { fill: var(--acc); font: 17px var(--mono); }
  .arch .p { fill: var(--acc); }
  .arch .t3 { fill: var(--acc); font: 500 16px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .14em; }
  .arch .up { fill: none; stroke: var(--acc); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 5; }
  .arch .u { fill: var(--acc); font: 500 17px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .note { max-width: 60ch; margin: 18px auto 0; text-align: center; color: #9a9a9a; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.6; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .note { text-align: left; }
    .arch .k, .arch .s, .arch .s2, .arch .v { font-size: 20px; }
    .arch .t2 { font-size: 22px; }
    .arch .t3, .arch .u { font-size: 19px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .arch .p { display: none; } }
</style>
